---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"About Youngjae Woo, a computational biologist working in genetics and drug discovery.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
  <h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
    <p>
      Hello, I am Youngjae Woo, a computational biologist based in San Diego specializing in the intersection of human genetics and artificial intelligence. My research leverages large-scale biomedical datasets to identify novel therapeutic targets and elucidate their underlying biological mechanisms. By translating complex, high-dimensional genomic data into clear, actionable insights, I focus on bridging the gap between advanced computational methodology and tangible clinical breakthroughs.
    </p>
    <p>
      Currently, my work is focused on applying advanced deep learning architectures, like Geneformer and Borzoi, to both target discovery and downstream drug development. Beyond my direct research, I am actively involved in fostering the local and global biotech community and facilitating knowledge exchange on the latest AI tools among bio-pharma professionals. Ultimately, I am deeply passionate about driving therapeutic innovation and translating data-driven science into clinical practice.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
